Error [jet.TypestateWrongState]: `check_in` needs `Reservation.Confirmed`, but `r` is `Reservation.Pending`
  --> tests/ui/typestate_wrong_state.jet:28:11
    |
 28 |     r = r.check_in()
    |           ^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate: `check_in` takes only `Reservation.Confirmed`; calling it with `Reservation` in another state is the out-of-order bug the state list rules out
 Fix: Moves from `Reservation.Pending`: `pay`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0150
